# Routing Conventions

- Define route path constants only in `RouteNames`.
- Start every route value with `/`.
- Keep route constant names in lowerCamelCase.
- Define route builders only in `AppRoutes.routes`.
- Use `RouteNames` keys inside `AppRoutes.routes`.
- Do not define route maps inside view/widget files.
- In `MaterialApp`, use `initialRoute` and `routes` with centralized route classes.
- Do not use `home:` when route maps are active.
